<title>UK: HypoBank sets warrants on MAN AG.</title>
<headline>HypoBank sets warrants on MAN AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hypo-Bank AG said it has issued 10 million American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on shares in German truck and machinery maker MAN AG.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.JAN.97-01.DEC.98   PAYDATE	23.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/MUN		   MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	   STRIKE PRICE	    ISSUE PRICE</p>
<p> CALL		420 DEM		   5.50 DEM</p>
<p>  PUT		380 DEM		   3.20 DEM</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
